  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A car is driving away from a stationary loudspeaker at a speed of 30 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>. The loudspeaker emits a sound of frequency 1000 Hz. The speed of sound in air is 330 m s<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the frequency of the sound heard by an observer traveling in the car?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{11000}{10}\"></span> Hz</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{11000}{12}\"></span> Hz</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{10000}{11}\"></span> Hz</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{12000}{11}\"></span> Hz</li>\n</ol>"
  },
